menu "Robo Racer"

config ROBO_WIFI_SSID
    string "SoftAP SSID"
    default "robo-racer"
    help
        Name the phone joins. 1 to 32 characters.

config ROBO_WIFI_PASS
    string "SoftAP password"
    default ""
    help
        WPA2 password, 8 to 63 characters. Leave this empty to generate a
        new password on every boot and print it on the serial console.
        The password is never embedded in the web page.

config ROBO_WIFI_CHANNEL
    int "SoftAP channel"
    range 1 13
    default 6
    help
        Fixed channel. Pick a quiet one at the venue. Command frames are
        sent immediately (no AMPDU), so a clean channel matters more than
        peak throughput.

endmenu
